      "writtenOn": "2018-03-28T18:13:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "And I prefer abbreviating instead of going over 50 chars. I wrap the body of my commit message to 72 chars as well. In general, I\u0027m a fan of abbreviations to save space.\n\nAnyways, I think chgstv2 isn\u0027t that cryptic and one should be able to tell from context that chgstv2 \u003d\u003d charge_state_v2, especially when the commit only has 1 file diff of charge_state_v2.c...\n\n\"chg pwr\" sure, maybe not the best.",
      "parentUuid": "8fd3c816_5ba3cef6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 7,
